{"id": "96ae5ea01e069060ea5e", "repository": "Jianing1117/jianing-skills", "commit_sha": "fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c", "skill_path": "awesome-creator-cover/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/blob/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/awesome-creator-cover/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "06d5980a1a6e5f017c67d46fa3d1da59055881bc", "sha256": "3bf63b7cde3eccf295bfc41ccc189af4aa3cebad477edac280cf8abba57ce878", "bytes": 3052, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T12:37:48.647603+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/awesome-creator-cover/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": [], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c.json", "local_package_files": ["awesome-creator-cover/SKILL.md", "awesome-creator-cover/scripts/make_cover.py"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: awesome-creator-cover\ndescription: |\n  白板风格短视频封面设计工具，适用于小红书和抖音。将标题、要点或脚本关键内容转为白板风格的封面图（.excalidraw 格式）。\n  当用户说「帮我做封面」「封面怎么做」「白板封面」「做一张封面图」「封面不知道怎么设计」时触发。\n  通常由 awesome-creator 主 Skill 路由调用，也可以直接触发。", "declared_name": "awesome-creator-cover", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "bb92fad4b5dfc5157cf0", "repository": "Jianing1117/jianing-skills", "commit_sha": "fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c", "skill_path": "awesome-creator-positioning/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/blob/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/awesome-creator-positioning/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "04238fe8f5400d308d226bf446dfe49b07d17b31", "sha256": "1cd9c276ab303affa4a38f68bbbdc29be1f496c3f2bd64f24512f737bbe898b1", "bytes": 16843, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T12:37:48.647963+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/awesome-creator-positioning/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": [], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c.json", "local_package_files": ["awesome-creator-positioning/SKILL.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: awesome-creator-positioning\ndescription: |\n  帮助抖音/小红书新手创作者从零确定内容定位。输出四件东西：一句话定位、平台分工建议、内容方向边界、初始内容主线。\n  当用户说「我不知道做什么方向」「帮我定位」「我想做自媒体但不知道从哪开始」「我的账号应该做什么内容」「我适合做哪个赛道」时触发。\n  起号前跑一次；content-engine 的诊断发现是选题层问题时也会指到这里。", "declared_name": "awesome-creator-positioning", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "04ece7fe375f4cd8a57e", "repository": "Jianing1117/jianing-skills", "commit_sha": "fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c", "skill_path": "content-engine/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/blob/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/content-engine/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "97a4251f580ca793cb4532a17698fc1d7063bf24", "sha256": "4d4fea7c9aed492445415ad7b2e262303ae3d14ea54d954cdca5c5af67e58c58", "bytes": 15973, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T12:37:48.648073+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/content-engine/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": [], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c.json", "local_package_files": ["content-engine/SKILL.md", "content-engine/awesome-creator.md", "content-engine/philosophy.md", "content-engine/playbook.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: content-engine\ndescription: |\n  会自我迭代的内容引擎。三件事：学（拆爆款沉淀方法论）、改（诊断并优化自己的稿子）、复盘（数据回流校准方法论）。\n  方法论活在 playbook.md 和用户的知识库里，不写死在流程里——方法论更新了，引擎的判断下一次就跟着变。\n  【学】丢来爆款视频链接、点点/小红书智能体的拆解、别人的高赞内容，或说「这条为什么能爆」「帮我拆一下」「这条值得学什么」时触发。\n  【改】丢来自己的脚本/文案/初稿，或说「帮我诊断」「这条能发吗」「改一下开头」「优化标题」「怎么让人看完」「切成短视频」时触发。\n  【复盘】说「月度复盘」「复盘一下」「数据导好了」时触发；随时说「这条起量了 / 扑了」也算，引擎当场拆。\n  不适用：从零起号定位（→awesome-creator-positioning）、封面制图（→awesome-creator-cover）、公众号排版（→wechat-formatter）。", "declared_name": "content-engine", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "adba833bd0d967c21b37", "repository": "Jianing1117/jianing-skills", "commit_sha": "fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c", "skill_path": "ip-cartoon-guide/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/blob/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/ip-cartoon-guide/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "495750a2c2eaa52079151d0dadf5730ff8cfad5e", "sha256": "cbbd8b60e1294c101fd19ab30934cb4323a45c1bce02bad5abad31a979a8c846", "bytes": 6608, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T12:37:48.648167+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/ip-cartoon-guide/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["ip-cartoon-guide/NOTICE.md"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c.json", "local_package_files": ["ip-cartoon-guide/NOTICE.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/SKILL.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/agents/openai.yaml", "ip-cartoon-guide/assets/default-demo-character-style-3.png", "ip-cartoon-guide/assets/style-reference-board.png", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/character-adapter.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/demo-mode.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/illustration-2d.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/illustration-3d.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/prompt-2d.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/prompt-3d.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/prompt-templates.md", "ip-cartoon-guide/references/stage-1.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": ["ip-cartoon-guide/assets/default-demo-character-style-3.png", "ip-cartoon-guide/assets/style-reference-board.png"], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: ip-cartoon-guide\ndescription: >-\n  Create a reusable personal IP character from user photos and optionally generate matching content illustrations.\n  Use for personal brand avatars, cartoon personas, creator mascots, 2D/line-art/watercolor or 3D/rendered character\n  guides, “个人IP形象指南”, and article or project illustrations that must preserve the same character. Supports a\n  two-stage flow, including a token-efficient direct Stage 2 entry and a built-in Style 3 demo when no personal IP,\n  photo, or style choice is available yet.", "declared_name": "ip-cartoon-guide", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
{"id": "5752df228f7ef46c9fa2", "repository": "Jianing1117/jianing-skills", "commit_sha": "fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c", "skill_path": "mindmirror/SKILL.md", "source_url": "https://github.com/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/blob/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/mindmirror/SKILL.md", "git_blob_sha": "7ceafcfaa74c9322ab8aac0495534da9124b1613", "sha256": "8e5a4babfaca99f3e30b96c77c05cafc14e49e8b31f969ee0d08f5aecb3beebe", "bytes": 12180, "collected_at": "2026-11-06T12:37:48.648232+00:00", "state": "collected", "raw_path": "raw/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c/mindmirror/SKILL.md", "execution_status": "not_executed", "quality_status": "not_evaluated", "license_candidates": ["mindmirror/LICENSE"], "repository_manifest": "manifests/Jianing1117/jianing-skills/fc9bb033c6e2d64a1e8618cb42b28c311f5c651c.json", "local_package_files": ["mindmirror/LICENSE", "mindmirror/README.md", "mindmirror/SKILL.md", "mindmirror/references/pathfinding.md", "mindmirror/references/profile.md", "mindmirror/references/questions.md"], "local_package_files_not_exported": [], "external_dependency_status": "not_fetched_or_verified", "path_review_hints": [], "frontmatter_raw": "name: mindmirror\ndescription: >-\n  观自在 · MindMirror——基于真实语料的自我认知工具箱。\n  基于用户的真实语料（Obsidian 笔记与日记、AI 记忆、对话历史）运行三种模式：①照见模式——带证据引用、\n  带置信度地回答 22 个自我认知问题，生成坦诚不奉承的自我画像；②数字分身模式——从语料起草十个维度的\n  「数字分身画像」（价值观/思维/情绪/关系/表达/审美/习惯等），用户只需校准；③人生规划模式——推演三种\n  未来五年人生剧本，拆路线图、评估得失、设计 90 天低成本验证实验。没有笔记和日记的用户也能用——\n  自动转入温和的访谈路径，聊出来的内容就是语料。当用户说「/mindmirror」「自省」「观自在」「心镜」\n  「帮我分析我自己」「我的盲点是什么」「给我做一份自我画像」「你觉得我是什么样的人」\n  「基于你对我的了解，说说我」「深度自我复盘」「数字分身」「帮我做人设画像」「我该选哪条路」\n  「帮我推演人生路径」「转行还是不转」「未来五年怎么走」时，务必使用此技能——即使用户没有说出这些确切词，\n  只要意图是\"让 AI 基于对我的了解做自我分析、自我描述或人生方向推演\"，都应触发。不适用于：\n  情绪疏导/心理咨询式陪聊、日常日记整理、对他人的分析、具体的投资理财建议。", "declared_name": "mindmirror", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
